In this lab, we have to disclose the admin password and delete the user "Carlos"

- To being, we try to login with out default creds.
- once you login in we can see the "update email" and "update password" field.
- The password is being masked, so we can't see it directly.
- Now in the URL parameter, if we change it from "wiener" to "administrator", then we can see the admin page.
- Still the password is masked, but there is one way to see it and that's when we intercept the traffic and analyse the request.

- So fire up your burp suit and intercept the traffic.
- So you will notice (with your default account) that if you try to update your password, it will masked on the screen but will be visible in the request.
- Similarly we have to do for the admin page.
- Change the URL parameter, go to admin page, just click on update password (don't change it).
- Now in the request, the password will be visible in the "password" parameter.
- Copy that and login as the administrator and delete the user "carlos".
- And your lab is completed.
